{"id":"st2016-4","designation":"ST 2016-4","title":"Active Format Description — Vertical Ancillary Data Mapping of Pan-Scan Information","state":"stabilized","suite":"2016","official":{"family_url":"https://pub.smpte.org/doc/st2016-4/","latest_url":"https://pub.smpte.org/latest/st2016-4/","checked_at":"2026-11-11"},"scope":"This Standard defines a method of coding that allows Pan-Scan information to be carried in the 10-bit vertical ancillary (VANC) data space of a standard definition or high definition bit-serial component television signal. The standard defines how the Pan-Scan information is placed into an ancillary data packet for carriage in accordance with SMPTE ST 291-1. An associated standard, SMPTE ST 2016-2, defines the format for Pan-Scan information and identifies the video image and interface standards with which it is associated.","outline":[],"definitions":[],"keywords":[{"term":"Ancillary Data","zh":"辅助数据","abbr":"","category":"tv","source":"curated"},{"term":"Closed Captioning","zh":"隐藏字幕","abbr":"CC","category":"accessibility","source":"curated"},{"term":"Vertical Blanking Interval","zh":"场消隐期","abbr":"","category":"tv","source":"curated"},{"term":"VANC","zh":"","abbr":"VANC","category":"other","source":"acronym"},{"term":"ANC","zh":"","abbr":"ANC","category":"other","source":"acronym"},{"term":"DID","zh":"","abbr":"DID","category":"other","source":"acronym"},{"term":"SDID","zh":"","abbr":"SDID","category":"other","source":"acronym"},{"term":"UDW","zh":"","abbr":"UDW","category":"other","source":"acronym"},{"term":"ADF","zh":"","abbr":"ADF","category":"other","source":"acronym"},{"term":"AFD","zh":"","abbr":"AFD","category":"other","source":"acronym"}],"refs":[{"id":"st2016-1","designation":"ST 2016-1"},{"id":"st2016-2","designation":"ST 2016-2"},{"id":"st2016-3","designation":"ST 2016-3"},{"id":"st291-1","designation":"ST 291-1"},{"id":"rp168","designation":"RP 168"},{"id":"st292-1","designation":"ST 292-1"},{"id":"st2036-3","designation":"ST 2036